"Scan a document" = "書類をスキャン";
"Letters, forms and receipts, straight from the camera. Private details are covered on this iPhone before anything leaves it." = "手紙、書類、レシートをカメラから直接。何かがこのiPhoneを出る前に、個人情報はこのiPhone上で隠されます。";
